---@field defaultGroupQuotaInKiBs? number Default group quota for volume in KiBs. If isDefaultQuotaEnabled is set, the minimum value of 4 KiBs applies.
---@field maximumNumberOfFiles? number Maximum number of files allowed. Needs a service request in order to be changed. Only allowed to be changed if volume quota is more than 4TiB.
